The wordmark in assets/banner-light.svg and assets/banner-dark.svg is
drawn as vector outlines derived from Roboto Medium. The letterforms are
converted to paths so they render identically for every visitor rather
than falling back to whatever sans-serif the viewer happens to have.

No Roboto font file is redistributed in this repository - only the
outlines of the eleven characters spelling "Back to You".

